@startuml
title 6. Update settings (content mode + categories)
autonumber
actor User
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Auth
database AuthDB

User -> Client : Change default mode / toggle categories
Client -> Gateway : PUT /auth/settings (Bearer)
Gateway -> Gateway : validate JWT
Gateway -> Auth : forward + user id
Auth -> Auth : validate payload (enum mode, known categories)
Auth -> AuthDB : upsert settings
Auth --> Client : 200 { settings }
note right of Client : client re-queries nearby\nwith new categories
@enduml
